WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.368 --> 00:00:03.570
-Special counsel Robert Mueller
recently provided

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:05.772
President Trump's lawyers
with a list of questions

00:00:05.772 --> 00:00:07.073
that he wants Trump to answer

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:08.874
as part of the ongoing
Russia investigation.

00:00:08.874 --> 00:00:11.277
"The New York Times"
published the list yesterday,

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:15.215
but what they don't know is that
Trump has a list of questions

00:00:15.215 --> 00:00:17.350
he'd like to ask Robert Mueller.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:19.318
We got our hands on it.
It's pretty interesting.

00:00:19.318 --> 00:00:21.320
So, here they are --
Donald Trump's questions

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.356
for Robert Mueller.

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:28.461 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.005 --> 00:00:41.074 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:05.365 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.537 --> 00:01:13.573
This has been Donald Trump's
questions for Robert Mueller.

